						data-date="17 Aug 2025"
						data-body="Context-Aware and Responsible AI Framework for East Africa (CARA-FMs) was accepted for presentation at Deep Learning Indaba 2025, Kigali, Rwanda. The paper proposes a theoretical framework for developing culturally attuned and resource-aware foundation models specifically for East African agricultural contexts, addressing issues of data sovereignty, local language integration, and ethical deployment. The paper subsequently won the Best Poster Award in the Publication & Dataset Category."
